---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy | Online Florist Singapore" description="How Online Florist Singapore handles personal information submitted through the website." canonicalPath="/privacy/">
  <section class="section"><div class="shell" style="max-width:760px">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1 style="font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,68px)">Privacy notice</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size:28px;margin-top:42px">Information we collect</h2>
    <p>When you send an enquiry, we collect the contact, occasion, delivery, message, and referral details shown in the form. We also keep a one-way hash of the request address for short-term abuse prevention. The raw address is not stored in the enquiry database.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:28px;margin-top:42px">How it is used</h2>
    <p>We use the information to reply to your enquiry, understand the requested delivery details, prevent repeated automated submissions, and see which pages helped visitors get in touch. We do not sell it.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:28px;margin-top:42px">Retention and requests</h2>
    <p>Enquiry records are kept only for customer service and operational needs. For privacy requests, use the contact form and include “Privacy request” in your message.</p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
